# Local preview copies of the standalone app.
# bach-office.html has to be served over HTTP for Tobby's .glb to load, so a
# copy gets dropped in public/ to serve it during development. It is a straight
# duplicate of the file at the repo root — tracking both is how the two quietly
# drift apart. The GLB under public/assets IS tracked: that is the path a
# deployed Next.js build serves it from.
/public/bach-office.html
/public/tobby-css-demo.html

